DongleSendSMSBase64: outgoing SMS text in Base64.

The text is decoded after Asterisk has split the application arguments, so
commas, quotes and dialplan syntax in the message stay text. Reject
noncanonical padding, invalid symbols and nonzero unused bits with a
content-free error log.
Applies after ingress.
License: GPL-2.0 (same as chan_dongle).
